// SYNTHESISABLE - becomes gates:
//   always_comb / always_ff / always_latch, assign, generate, functions
//   for loops with STATIC bounds, parameters, packed types, case, enums
//
// NOT SYNTHESISABLE - simulation only:
//   #10 delays          fork/join           wait
//   initial blocks*     classes, new()      dynamic/associative arrays
//   real, string        $display, $random   while (dynamic_condition)
//   force/release       events              constraints, covergroups
//
// * FPGA block-RAM and flop initialisation is the one real exception:
//   an initial block sets the bitstream's power-up value. On an ASIC
//   it is ignored, silently. Never rely on it in portable RTL.
//
// The test is not "does it elaborate" - almost everything elaborates.
// The test is "can this be built from gates and flops with no notion
// of wall-clock time". A `#10` has no hardware meaning. A `while` with
// a data-dependent bound has no bounded gate count.

